values ('bacc1010-2024-4000-8000-000000000003', 'kh-grade12-science-mathematics-integrals', null, 2024, 'open', 'គណនាអាំងតេក្រាល៖
ក. $\displaystyle I=\int_1^e\left[2x+1+\frac{\ln x}{x}\right]dx$
