values ('bacc1010-2014-4100-8000-000000000002', 'kh-grade12-science-mathematics-complex-numbers', null, 2014, 'open', 'គេឲ្យចំនួនកុំផ្លិច $z_1=-1+i\sqrt{3}$ និង $z_2=-1-i\sqrt{3}$។
